Approach: Two Pointer 
Use two pointers:
i → start of string
j → end of string
If s[i] == s[j] → move both pointers (i++, j--)
If mismatch occurs:
We are allowed to remove only one character
So check two cases:
Ignore left character → check palindrome (i+1, j)
Ignore right character → check palindrome (i, j-1)
If any one is palindrome → return true

Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
